      "costUsd": 0.0064280000000000006,
      "pronunciationText": "When is the cabin seventeen metres up, in the first turn? Twelve minus ten cos equals seventeen, so cos of pi t over thirty is minus a half. That's an exact value. Cos is minus a half at two pi over three and four pi over three, so t is twenty seconds, or forty seconds. On the wheel, those are the two moments the cabin passes seventeen metres, once on the way up, and once on the way down."
