      "pronunciationText": "The midline c is the middle of fourteen and a half and nine and a half: twelve. The amplitude k is half the gap: two point five. Six months is half a cycle, so the period is twelve months and ay is pi over six. At t equals two, cos of pi over three is a half, so D is twelve plus one point two five: thirteen point two five hours. An amplitude of five uses the whole gap, not half."
