      "pronunciationText": "One point five sine of pi t over eight is point seven five, so sine of pi t over eight is a half. Sine is a half at pi over six and five pi over six. Multiply by eight over pi: t is four thirds of a second, and twenty thirds of a second. Pi over six is the angle inside, not the time."
